ewear Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-12 15:05:06", "symbol": "CAMPUS", "voiceSummary": "Campus Activewear Limited filed a transcript of its Q2 and H1 FY’27 earnings conference call held on 05th November 2026. The company reported revenue growth of 16.9% year-on-year to Rs. 452 crores, driven by a 10.2% volume increase to 6.3 million pairs and a 6% rise in average selling price. EBITDA grew by 12.5% to Rs. 62 crores, while profit after tax increased by 21.3% to Rs. 24 crores. Management highlighted strong performance in Women and Kids categories, which grew by 27% and 34% respectively in the first half of FY’27. Gross margins stood at 51.4%, impacted by input cost inflation. The company expects full-year FY’27 EBITDA margins of 17% and aims for mid-teens growth in the coming year.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/CAMPUSSHOES_12112026150424_earningscallsigned.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "06-Nov-2026 13:20:44", "attFileSize": "26.62 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CAMPUSSHOES_06112026132004_NPSIGNED.pdf", "attchmntText": "Campus Activewear Limited has informed the Exchange about Copy of Newspaper Publication", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Copy of Newspaper Publication", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "06112026132044", "exchdisstime": "06-Nov-2026 13:20:45", "fileSize": "26.62 MB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106849926", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE278Y01022", "sm_name": "Campus Activewear Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-06 13:20:44", "symbol": "CAMPUS", "voiceSummary": null, "voiceUrl": null}, {"an_dt": "05-Nov-2026 16:17:56", "attFileSize": "367.19 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CAMPUSSHOES_05112026161745_AUDIOSIGNED.pdf", "attchmntText": "Campus Activewear Limited has informed the Exchange about Link of Recording", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates", "difference": "00:00:01",